---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy | StockSentry AI Stock App">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="pt-32 pb-12 px-4 border-b border-slate-800 bg-dark-900">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider">Zero financial visibility. Period.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12">
        
        <section>
            <div class="bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/30 p-6 rounded-lg mb-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Strict Boundaries of StockSentry</h2>
                <p class="text-[var(--text-base)] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    StockSentry operates on a principle of absolute minimum data collection. Because we do not act as your financial advisor, we structurally ensure we have no insight into your personal finances.
                </p>
                <h3 class="text-brand-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 mt-6">What We Collect (Only 2 Things):</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-[var(--text-base)] marker:text-brand-500 mb-6">
                    <li><strong>Your app ID:</strong> The numerical string required by the app API to route messages back to your chat.</li>
                    <li><strong>Your Inputted Tickers & Entry Prices:</strong> The data you actively send to the app via <code>/watch</code> or <code>/bought</code> commands to trigger monitoring.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">What We DO NOT Collect:</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-[var(--text-base)] marker:text-red-500">
                    <li>We cannot see your brokerage account, login credentials, or transaction history.</li>
                    <li>We do not know your real name, email address, physical address, or phone number.</li>
                    <li>We do not know your portfolio size, income, net worth, or financial status.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Third-Party Subprocessors</h2>
            <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                To deliver the service, we interact with the following third parties. We only share the absolute minimum data required to execute their specific function.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">
                <li class="bg-dark-900 p-4 rounded border border-slate-700">
                    <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Stripe (Payment Processing)</strong>
                    When you subscribe, you are redirected to Stripe. StockSentry does not store or process your credit card information. Stripe maintains your billing details.
                </li>
                <li class="bg-dark-900 p-4 rounded border border-slate-700">
                    <strong class="text-white block mb-1">app (Messaging)</strong>
                    All communication occurs over app's infrastructure. We are subject to app's privacy policy regarding message transit.
                </li>
                <li class="bg-dark-900 p-4 rounded border border-slate-700">
                    <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Anthropic / Claude (AI Analysis)</strong>
                    When an alert is generated, we send the technical financial data to Claude to write the plain-English summary. <span class="text-brand-500">Your app ID is never sent to the AI.</span> The AI only sees raw market data (e.g., "AAPL RSI is 25, write a summary").
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Data Deletion</h2>
            <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] text-sm leading-relaxed">
                If you cancel your subscription and block the app on app, you can request a complete wipe of your tracked tickers and historical agent interactions by contacting support. 
            </p>
        </section>

    </main>
</MainLayout>
